Package: fonts-dot-os
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fontconfig
Description: DOT OS typefaces: Doto, Space Grotesk, Space Mono
 The three SIL Open Font License families the DOT OS interface is set in,
 with a fontconfig file that makes them the default sans and monospace.
